                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "61b2cc8c-6cfa-3096-8c7d-d26973eb234a",
                        "entry_id": "96c765e9-a4dd-3f9f-ab79-b545ff9a88ff",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Montagnard des Highlands, en Écosse."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "57eafc18-cfff-4cea-bb42-9221ae8f621f",
                                "sense_id": "61b2cc8c-6cfa-3096-8c7d-d26973eb234a",
                                "text": "Il se rappela dans les moindres détails le costume du highlander qui lui avait vendu le bag-pipe, son bonnet orné d’un chardon, sa claymore, son habit serré aux pans courts et carrés, son jupon, le scilt or philaberg, orné de la bourse sporran et du smushing-mull, tabatière de corne, son épingle faite d’une pierre écossaise, ses deux ceintures, la sashwise et le belts, son épée, le swond, son coutelas, le dirck, et le skene dhu, couteau noir à poignée noire ornée de deux cairgorums, et les genoux nus de ce soldat, ses bas, ses guêtres quadrillées et ses souliers à boucles."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "85faa86d-6177-4aa6-b5b2-b9a5a0bf1480",
                                "sense_id": "61b2cc8c-6cfa-3096-8c7d-d26973eb234a",
                                "text": "L’origine de ces toasts est entièrement barbare et l’on m’a dit que les highlanders de l’Écosse, peuplades demi-sauvages qui vivent dans un état de perpétuelle discorde […] ont gardé à cette coutume son caractère original. Boire à la santé de quelqu’un, c’est le prier de veiller sur vous pendant que vous buvez et que vous vous trouvez sans défense."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "02a80950-649a-4d7e-8e07-d526d713c6e3",
                                "sense_id": "61b2cc8c-6cfa-3096-8c7d-d26973eb234a",
                                "text": "Sa grand-mère maternelle fut une remarquable femme d’affaires, qui menait ses highlanders à la baguette, dans son domaine de Laurencekirk."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1d3e86a8-9237-4dcd-a382-c6bcb1f62e7e",
                        "source_entry_id": "96c765e9-a4dd-3f9f-ab79-b545ff9a88ff",
                        "source_sense_id": "61b2cc8c-6cfa-3096-8c7d-d26973eb234a",
                        "target_lang_word": "highlander",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "highlander",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b7e3a885-6e30-3e01-beae-afe1116a2b0e",
                                        "entry_id": "2a9aba89-4081-3f27-bd23-c1e6536a81ad",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who inhabits the Scottish Highlands."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Scotland"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a9188be3-8b9a-3f8f-b9ce-2888fe7932d6",
                                        "entry_id": "2a9aba89-4081-3f27-bd23-c1e6536a81ad",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any person who lives in mountainous or hilly terrain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "580d4a2d-0bbd-40e9-89de-c33d4031290b",
                                                "sense_id": "a9188be3-8b9a-3f8f-b9ce-2888fe7932d6",
                                                "text": "He gave credence to the long-standing impression that southern highlanders were as a whole 'a hardy race of European dissenters' of very different stock from other southern colonists…. As backwoodsmen and highlanders, they opposed slavery formally, through abolitionist organizations, newspapers, or institutions of higher education…."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b49f0b7-a965-42fd-a6dd-b793b72efadf",
                                                "sense_id": "a9188be3-8b9a-3f8f-b9ce-2888fe7932d6",
                                                "text": "Other essayists, however, detect significant distinctions between highlander and lowlander—differences in racial attitudes (abolitionist or rabid racist), in the types of work that African Americans performed, and in the extent to which perceptions of whiteness shaped how outsiders understood the region and acted toward it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eefd6f0a-f473-36ad-8ff2-935e20fbffbe",
                                        "entry_id": "2a9aba89-4081-3f27-bd23-c1e6536a81ad",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The Igorot people, referring to them originating from the Cordillera Mountain Range."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Philippines"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "highlander",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fb647518-33fd-3c0e-ad9f-a89b4b6f432b",
                                        "entry_id": "fdcce0a9-03fc-3d84-9638-77340e1e67c8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A game format in which players are allowed no more than one of any card (except basic resource cards) in their decks."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "capitalized",
                                            "often",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b749b86-96f1-4b33-bbee-318b440f0edb",
                                                "sense_id": "fb647518-33fd-3c0e-ad9f-a89b4b6f432b",
                                                "text": "I have a blue/white highlander deck (every card is unique, including the lands) and I would like some help tuning it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73c13037-eb7d-4118-bc19-4dc3530eef43",
                                                "sense_id": "fb647518-33fd-3c0e-ad9f-a89b4b6f432b",
                                                "text": "As an example, the \"Highlander\" tournaments (only one of any particular card) that have been springing up have proven to be a good way to re-energize the tournament scene for some games."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a94ec5d9-11dc-43f3-a26b-900207eff0fa",
                                                "sense_id": "fb647518-33fd-3c0e-ad9f-a89b4b6f432b",
                                                "text": "One of my favorite Highlander decks is listed below."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
